# Measured behaviour of the .NET driver's command conversions, the reference for
# commandconv.go. Produced by running csharp_convert_probe.cs.txt on .NET 8 with
# MongoDB.Bson 3.4.2 (the driver's own dependency):
#   SCALAR  Convert.ToXxx(BsonDouble)            - src/OPC-UA-Client/MongoCommands.cs, scalar switch
#   ARRAY   JsonNode.Parse(..)[0].GetValue<T>()  - same file, array switch
# "EXC <name>" means the .NET driver throws, so the command is cancelled with
# "type conversion error". Do not edit by hand; regenerate with the probe.
# The Float column is deliberately absent: Go refuses a finite value that
# overflows a Float where .NET writes Infinity (deviation D21).
